# The same trick on a longer ring: the round trip takes 20 delays, so each site fires less often.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Ring of 20 holding a circulating pulse
sites 20
path 1 20 kappa=0.06
link 20 1 kappa=0.06
kick 1 amplitude=2
kick 20 time=185 amplitude=2
run 1850
